rophies like <i>&quot;Existential Crisis&quot;</i> (do nothing for 3 years) and many other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425980/extras/6687cb9107b1095d49c9cbfef8872c13.poster.avif?t=1765573204\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425980/extras/6687cb9107b1095d49c9cbfef8872c13.webm?t=1765573204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425980/extras/6687cb9107b1095d49c9cbfef8872c13.mp4?t=1765573204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Be a Rock?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zen Mode</strong>: Chill with calming ambient sounds and minimalist visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meme Fuel</strong>: Perfect for streamers craving irony or players who enjoy <i>&quot;so bad it\u2019s good&quot;</i> humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero Skill Required</strong>: Your only job? Exist. (Seriously, you can\u2019t even move.)</p></li></ul>","developers":["STFGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425980/576bd9837b7a853af3aebf4e01fa4a01a549a59f/header.jpg?t=1765573204","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><